# Design System

## Color tokens (from DS object in docs/design/components/shared.jsx)
```
cream:        #F5F2EC   bg-cream
charcoal:     #2C2A25   text-charcoal
secondary:    #7A7060   text-secondary
amber:        #8B5E3C   text-amber / border-amber
amberLight:   #FAEEDA   bg-amber-light
amberDeep:    #633806   text-amber-deep
rule:         #D4C9B5   border-rule
annotationBg: #F0EBE0   bg-annotation
disputedBg:   #EDE0D8   bg-disputed
disputedText: #6B3020   text-disputed
closedBg:     #ECEAE6   bg-closed
closedText:   #4A4640   text-closed
```

## StatusPill variants
- CLOSED → bg-closed text-closed
- OPEN → bg-amber-light text-amber-deep
- DISPUTED → bg-disputed text-disputed
All: font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-wider rounded-full px-2 py-0.5

## InstitutionalSeal
SVG. Outer ring: "MWISHO WA MWISHO DISTRICT HERITAGE TRUST" on textPath in EB Garamond.
Inner: 3 horizontal lines of decreasing width. Amber stroke, cream fill. Accepts size prop.

## HeritageTrustNote
bg-annotation border-l-2 border-amber px-4 py-3.
Label: "HERITAGE TRUST NOTE —" in font-mono text-[9px] text-amber-deep uppercase tracking-widest.
Body: font-sans text-sm text-charcoal leading-relaxed.

## PullQuote
border-l-2 border-amber pl-5 my-6.
Quote: font-serif text-lg italic text-charcoal leading-snug.
Attribution: font-sans text-xs text-secondary mt-2.

## FilterBar (client component)
Tab row. Active tab: text-amber font-semibold border-b-2 border-amber.
Inactive: text-secondary border-b-2 border-transparent.
Mobile: overflow-x-auto, no wrapping.
